# Rendered output. The .d2 source is committed, the picture is built from it;
# a repository about not committing generated files should not commit its own.
*.svg
*.png

# Backups written by the installer, if the default location is overridden into
# a checkout. A backup inside a directory that gets copied elsewhere is the
# specific mistake this repository documents.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.rej

# AI assistant artefacts.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.ai-context/
.memsearch/
.opencode/

# Work notes about this repository — kept per checkout, not part of what ships.
kb/

# Python bytecode.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS and editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
